Graphviz DOT / GV test files (depth-1 top-level only) for the reader-dot module.
A mix of graphs collected from the web (each with its source URL migrated from the old
*.gv.meta pointer files) and small synthetic example*.dot graphs authored within the
GraphInOut project to exercise specific DOT-parser features.

ddot.it/this ..format.. format:dot
ddot.it/this ..authored by.. Calpano (graphinout)   # applies to the synthetic example*.dot files only

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Collected graphs (source URL migrated from *.gv.meta, now deleted)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Call_Graph.gv ..kind.. collected
Call_Graph.gv ..format.. format:dot
Call_Graph.gv ..content.. Dependency / call graph of software-metric computations (Halstead length, vocabulary, volume, effort, difficulty, maintainability index, cyclomatic complexity, ...) rooted at an "EclipseStatistic" node.
Call_Graph.gv ..depicts.. metric-dependency call graph from the "Halstead's Revenge" project
Call_Graph.gv ..tests.. node/edge attribute lists, group edge target "X -> { a, b, c }" syntax, rankdir/layout/size graph attributes, inline "#" line comments
Call_Graph.gv ..source url.. https://gitlab.eecs.wsu.edu/42986/halsteads-revenge/-/blob/halsteadUnitTests/Call_Graph.gv
Call_Graph.gv ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)

dt_surrogate_mojo.gv ..kind.. collected
dt_surrogate_mojo.gv ..format.. format:dot
dt_surrogate_mojo.gv ..content.. A decision-tree surrogate model (credit-card payment / PAY_* features) exported as a MOJO by H2O-3's PrintMojo tool; nodes grouped by tree level inside a cluster subgraph.
dt_surrogate_mojo.gv ..depicts.. H2O machine-learning decision-tree surrogate model
dt_surrogate_mojo.gv ..tests.. subgraph clusters, nested anonymous subgraph blocks, C-style /* */ comments, quoted node ids and labels with operators (e.g. "PAY_AMT5 < 1515.5")
dt_surrogate_mojo.gv ..source url.. https://resources.oreilly.com/oriole/interpretable-machine-learning-with-python-xgboost-and-h2o/-/blob/master/dt_surrogate_mojo.gv
dt_surrogate_mojo.gv ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)

graph_coloring_z3_example_fat_graph.gv ..kind.. collected
graph_coloring_z3_example_fat_graph.gv ..format.. format:dot
graph_coloring_z3_example_fat_graph.gv ..content.. Large (~8.3k lines) "fat" graph used as a graph-coloring example for the Z3 theorem prover; many filled circle nodes with colored edges.
graph_coloring_z3_example_fat_graph.gv ..depicts.. graph-coloring instance for the Z3 SMT solver
graph_coloring_z3_example_fat_graph.gv ..tests.. large-input parsing/performance, multi-line attribute lists, quoted alphanumeric node ids
graph_coloring_z3_example_fat_graph.gv ..source url.. https://github.com/0vercl0k/z3-playground/blob/master/graph_coloring_z3_example_fat_graph.gv
graph_coloring_z3_example_fat_graph.gv ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)

graphviz-call-graph.dot.gv ..kind.. collected
graphviz-call-graph.dot.gv ..format.. format:dot
graphviz-call-graph.dot.gv ..content.. Classic Graphviz C call-graph example; functions grouped into clusters by source/header file (ciafan.c, util.c, error.h, sfio.h, query.h, field.h).
graphviz-call-graph.dot.gv ..depicts.. C program call graph, functions clustered by file
graphviz-call-graph.dot.gv ..tests.. multiple edges per line, named "cluster_*" subgraphs with labels, size/ratio graph attributes
graphviz-call-graph.dot.gv ..source url.. https://gemfury.com/bvberkum/js:node-sitefile/0.0.4/content/example/graphviz-call-graph.dot.gv
graphviz-call-graph.dot.gv ..license.. not stated (public domain unless otherwise stated)

libinput-stack-xorg.gv ..kind.. collected
