libinput-stack-xorg.gv ..content.. libinput input-event stack under the X.org server: kernel /dev/input/event* devices through xf86-input-libinput to an X11 client.
libinput-stack-xorg.gv ..depicts.. libinput / X.org input-event processing stack
libinput-stack-xorg.gv ..tests.. compound=true with rankdir, nested clusters, box-shaped nodes
