oberon.gv ..kind.. collected
oberon.gv ..format.. format:dot
oberon.gv ..content.. Genealogy of the Oberon family of programming languages (Pascal, Modula-2, Oberon, Oberon-2/SA/07, Object Oberon, ...) and their influence relations.
oberon.gv ..depicts.. Oberon programming-language genealogy / family tree
